        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86125, Classic Rope Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Rope Cabinet Pull is a timeless classic. This chunky cabinet pull is perfect for your Classic Italian Kitchen. The Classic Rope Cabinet Pull is available in a wide array of stunning finish colors and 4 sizes. This luxury cabinet handle comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Rope Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86125-specifications.pdf?v=1704262413\"><b>Emtek Rope Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86125:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86126:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86127:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86247:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-9-finish.jpg?v=1704354579\" width=\"597\" height=\"89\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
